{"seq":3,"slug":"pagination-aggregate-consistency","title":"分页/聚合/折叠一致性 Diff","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/result-set-diff/pagination-aggregate-consistency","wordCount":2399,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"分页-聚合-折叠一致性-diff\">分页/聚合/折叠一致性 Diff</h1><p>前面两篇比对的是「单次请求的单个响应」。这一篇比对的是<strong>响应之间的关系</strong>——第 1 页和第 2 页拼起来是否连续？聚合桶的计数和总量是否吻合？折叠后的结果数是否等于折叠键的数量？这类差异的特点是：两边的每一次单独响应看起来都正常，问题只在把它们放在一起时才显形。发布一个改动后，「搜索能返回结果」和「搜索结果自洽」是两件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类一致性的对象与失效形态\">核心概念：三类一致性的对象与失效形态</h2><p>分页、聚合、折叠是搜索响应里三个涉及「跨请求关系」的部分，它们各有自己的不变量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[变更上线] --&gt; B{哪类不变量被破坏?}&#10;  B --&gt;|跨页| C[分页连续性]&#10;  B --&gt;|跨桶| D[聚合恒等式]&#10;  B --&gt;|组内| E[折叠代表性]&#10;  C --&gt; F[重复 / 遗漏 / 顺序漂移]&#10;  D --&gt; G[桶和 != 总数 / 桶键缺失]&#10;  E --&gt; H[代表文档换了 / 组容量异常]\">graph TD\n  A[变更上线] --&gt; B{哪类不变量被破坏?}\n  B --&gt;|跨页| C[分页连续性]\n  B --&gt;|跨桶| D[聚合恒等式]\n  B --&gt;|组内| E[折叠代表性]\n  C --&gt; F[重复 / 遗漏 / 顺序漂移]\n  D --&gt; G[桶和 != 总数 / 桶键缺失]\n  E --&gt; H[代表文档换了 / 组容量异常]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>不变量</th>\n<th>失效表现</th>\n<th>用户可见后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分页</td>\n<td>跨页无重复、无遗漏、全局有序</td>\n<td>第 2 页出现第 1 页的文档</td>\n<td>重复商品、翻页跳变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合</td>\n<td>桶计数和 = 总命中数、桶集合稳定</td>\n<td>类目计数对不上总数</td>\n<td>筛选器数字失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折叠</td>\n<td>每组一条代表、组数 = 不同键数</td>\n<td>同一 SPU 出现两次</td>\n<td>结果被同一商品占满</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么这三类一致性在回放里特别重要\">为什么这三类一致性在回放里特别重要</h3><p>三者的共同点是<strong>依赖全局状态或跨请求状态</strong>。分页依赖一个在请求之间保持稳定的全序；聚合依赖一次扫描里所有匹配文档的完整视图；折叠依赖分组逻辑在两次请求间给出同样的代表。任何引入了新的不确定性（同分打散随机化、分片并行归并顺序变化、聚合近似算法改动）的变更，都可能在单次响应看起来完全正常的情况下破坏这些不变量。</p>\n<p>而回放是唯一能大规模检查这类问题的场合——线上不可能对每个用户都翻三页并核对。回放可以：把同一个查询的 from=0 和 from=20 都跑一遍，把两页拼起来检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分页一致性-跨页拼接检查\">分页一致性：跨页拼接检查</h2><p>分页一致性的检查方法非常直接：对同一个查询，分别回放 <code>from=0,size=20</code>、<code>from=20,size=20</code>、<code>from=40,size=20</code>，把结果拼成一个 60 长的序列，然后在基准和候选两侧分别检查三个性质。</p>\n<p><strong>无重复</strong>：拼接序列里同一 doc_id 只出现一次。重复出现意味着排序不是全序——存在同分文档在不同请求间顺序不稳定，或者分页的 offset 语义在某处被偏移了一位。</p>\n<p><strong>无遗漏</strong>：如果单次请求支持取更深的窗口（如 <code>size=60</code>），那么拼接结果应该与深窗口结果集合相同。差集就是被遗漏的文档。</p>\n<p><strong>全局有序</strong>：拼接序列的 score 应当单调不增（或者按声明的排序键单调）。违反单调意味着两页用了不一致的排序上下文。</p>\n<h3 id=\"深分页与游标\">深分页与游标</h3><p><code>from/size</code> 式分页有一个根本问题：它假设索引在两次请求之间没有变化。线上环境中，如果两次翻页之间有文档写入，排序会整体偏移，导致第 2 页重复第 1 页的尾部。这在线上是无解的（除非用游标），但在回放里恰恰是要验证的：<strong>变更是否让这个问题变得更严重</strong>。</p>\n<p>因此分页一致性要分两种模式回放：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>检验目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冻结索引</td>\n<td>同一索引快照下翻页</td>\n<td>纯排序稳定性（同分处理、归并顺序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量索引</td>\n<td>两次翻页之间插入新文档</td>\n<td>变更对「翻阅期间数据变化」的鲁棒性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二种模式是深度变更（分析器、mapping）才需要做的，因为它要求回放器能在翻页之间对索引做受控写入。多数团队只做第一种，因为第二种的构造成本高且线上行为本来就不可控。但如果是把 <code>from/size</code> 换成游标分页这样的<strong>分页机制变更</strong>，第二种就是必做的——游标分页的价值恰恰在于对增量写入的鲁棒性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsonc\" data-code=\"// 分页一致性检查的任务声明&#10;{&#10;  &quot;check&quot;: &quot;pagination_consistency&quot;,&#10;  &quot;query_ref&quot;: &quot;4bf92f35…&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pages&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: 0, &quot;size&quot;: 20 },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: 20, &quot;size&quot;: 20 },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: 40, &quot;size&quot;: 20 },&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;assert&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;no_duplicate_doc&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;no_gap_vs_deep_window&quot;: { &quot;deep_size&quot;: 60 },&#10;    &quot;score_monotonic&quot;: true,&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;on_data_change&quot;: &quot;frozen&quot;, // frozen | tolerant | fail&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 分页一致性检查的任务声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"check\": \"pagination_consistency\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"query_ref\": \"4bf92f35…\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"pages\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { \"from\": 0, \"size\": 20 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { \"from\": 20, \"size\": 20 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { \"from\": 40, \"size\": 20 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"assert\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"no_duplicate_doc\": true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"no_gap_vs_deep_window\": { \"deep_size\": 60 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"score_monotonic\": true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"on_data_change\": \"frozen\", // frozen | tolerant | fail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>on_data_change</code> 的取值直接影响判定：<code>frozen</code> 要求翻页期间索引完全不变，<code>tolerant</code> 允许变化但要求重复率低于阈值，<code>fail</code> 表示任何重复都算回归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合一致性-恒等式与桶稳定性\">聚合一致性：恒等式与桶稳定性</h2><p>聚合的问题比翻页更隐蔽。搜索响应里的聚合桶（品牌分布、价格区间、类目统计）常常被用作筛选器的候选值和计数展示。用户看到「蓝牙耳机（1,203）」，点进去理应看到 1203 个结果。这个恒等式一旦不成立，就是明显的产品缺陷。</p>\n<h3 id=\"恒等式检查\">恒等式检查</h3><p>最基本的两个恒等式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>category</mtext></msub></mrow></munder><mtext>count</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>any</mtext></msub></mrow></munder><mtext>count</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{total}} = \\sum_{b \\in B_{\\text{category}}} \\text{count}(b), \\qquad N_{\\text{total}} \\geq \\sum_{b \\in B_{\\text{any}}} \\text{count}(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5494em;vertical-align:-1.4994em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">category</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5494em;vertical-align:-1.4994em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">any</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一个是「按某个全量维度分桶，桶计数之和等于总命中数」（要求该维度对所有文档都有值）；第二个是「任意维度的桶计数和在过滤条件下不超过总命中数」。可变性是这里的坑：如果某维度的分桶使用了近似算法（如基数统计、terms 聚合的 <code>shard_size</code> 截断），桶和会略小于总数。这时要检查的是<strong>偏差是否在声明范围内</strong>，而不是要求精确相等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"桶集合稳定性\">桶集合稳定性</h3><p>比计数更值得关注的是桶<strong>集合</strong>的变化。一个品牌从筛选器里消失，意味着用户失去了这个筛选入口——即使它的计数很小。因此聚合 Diff 要同时比对桶键集合与计数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 聚合桶差异：基准 vs 候选&#10;WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT trace_id, agg_name, bucket_key, doc_count, sampling_weight&#10;  FROM replay_agg WHERE replay_run_id = :run AND version = &#39;baseline&#39;&#10;), cand AS (&#10;  SELECT trace_id, agg_name, bucket_key, doc_count, sampling_weight&#10;  FROM replay_agg WHERE replay_run_id = :run AND version = &#39;candidate&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  COALESCE(b.trace_id, c.trace_id)     AS trace_id,&#10;  COALESCE(b.agg_name, c.agg_name)     AS agg_name,&#10;  COALESCE(b.bucket_key, c.bucket_key) AS bucket_key,&#10;  b.doc_count AS count_base, c.doc_count AS count_cand,&#10;  CASE&#10;    WHEN b.bucket_key IS NULL THEN &#39;bucket_added&#39;&#10;    WHEN c.bucket_key IS NULL THEN &#39;bucket_removed&#39;&#10;    WHEN b.doc_count = c.doc_count THEN &#39;same&#39;&#10;    WHEN abs(b.doc_count - c.doc_count)::numeric / GREATEST(b.doc_count,1) &lt; 0.01 THEN &#39;minor&#39;&#10;    ELSE &#39;count_changed&#39;&#10;  END AS delta_kind&#10;FROM base b FULL OUTER JOIN cand c USING (trace_id, agg_name, bucket_key)&#10;WHERE b.doc_count IS DISTINCT FROM c.doc_count OR b.bucket_key IS NULL OR c.bucket_key IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 聚合桶差异：基准 vs 候选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_id, agg_name, bucket_key, doc_count, sampling_weight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_agg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_run_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :run </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'baseline'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), cand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_id, agg_name, bucket_key, doc_count, sampling_weight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_agg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_run_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :run </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'candidate'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">trace_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">trace_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">agg_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">agg_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agg_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count_base, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count_cand,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bucket_added'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bucket_removed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'same'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'minor'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'count_changed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta_kind</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FULL OUTER JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cand c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (trace_id, agg_name, bucket_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>count_changed</code> 用 1% 的容差把「微小计数抖动」与「真实计数变化」分开——聚合计数受分片归并顺序、近似算法截断影响会有微小波动，把它全算差异会让报告噪声过大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"折叠一致性-代表文档与组容量\">折叠一致性：代表文档与组容量</h2><p>折叠（collapse / dedup）让同一组文档只保留一条代表，典型场景是「同一 SPU 的多个 SKU 只展示一个」「同一店铺的多个商品只展示一个」。折叠的 Diff 要检查两件事：<strong>代表选择是否稳定</strong>、<strong>组容量是否异常</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代表选择的稳定性\">代表选择的稳定性</h3><p>如果折叠键相同但代表文档换了，看起来会是一对 ADDED/REMOVED（见 <a href=\"doc-set-add-remove-diff\">结果新增/消失逐条比对</a> 里提到的「换了代表」），但语义完全不同：这不是召回变化，而是折叠策略变化。因此 Diff 引擎必须<strong>在折叠前做一次比对</strong>，把「同一折叠组内换代表」识别出来并单列。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def diff_after_collapse(base_hits, cand_hits, key_fn):&#10;    base_groups = group_by(base_hits, key_fn)&#10;    cand_groups = group_by(cand_hits, key_fn)&#10;    result = {&quot;rep_swapped&quot;: [], &quot;group_lost&quot;: [], &quot;group_added&quot;: []}&#10;    for k, bg in base_groups.items():&#10;        cg = cand_groups.get(k)&#10;        if cg is None:&#10;            result[&quot;group_lost&quot;].append(k); continue&#10;        if bg.representative.sku_id != cg.representative.sku_id:&#10;            result[&quot;rep_swapped&quot;].append({&#10;                &quot;group&quot;: k,&#10;                &quot;base_rep&quot;: bg.representative.sku_id,&#10;                &quot;cand_rep&quot;: cg.representative.sku_id,&#10;                &quot;ranks&quot;: [bg.representative.rank, cg.representative.rank],&#10;            })&#10;    result[&quot;group_added&quot;] = [k for k in cand_groups if k not in base_groups]&#10;    return result\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> diff_after_collapse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(base_hits, cand_hits, key_fn):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    base_groups </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group_by(base_hits, key_fn)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cand_groups </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group_by(cand_hits, key_fn)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rep_swapped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [], </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group_lost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [], </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group_added\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, bg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_groups.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cand_groups.get(k)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group_lost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].append(k); </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bg.representative.sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cg.representative.sku_id:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rep_swapped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].append({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: k,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"base_rep\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: bg.representative.sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"cand_rep\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: cg.representative.sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"ranks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [bg.representative.rank, cg.representative.rank],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group_added\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cand_groups </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_groups]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>rep_swapped</code> 的正确处理方式取决于业务：如果折叠规则是「组内最高分者代表」，那么分数变化导致换代表是完全正常的，应归入预期；如果折叠规则是「组内固定代表（如最低价）」，那么换代表说明折叠键或代表选择逻辑变了，属于回归候选。</p>\n<h3 id=\"组容量与结果数守恒\">组容量与结果数守恒</h3><p>折叠后的结果数应当等于「不同折叠键的数量」在展示窗口内的值。如果候选版本折叠后的结果数明显少于基准，可能是折叠键被改宽了（把不相关的文档折到一起）。检查方式是比较两版的平均组容量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>折叠前命中数</mtext><mtext>折叠后结果数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{c} = \\frac{\\text{折叠前命中数}}{\\text{折叠后结果数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">折叠后结果数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">折叠前命中数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 1.3 跳到 3.1 意味着平均每个结果代表了三个商品，用户实际能看到的商品多样性骤降。这是一个业务上很严重但技术上很隐蔽的回归——单次响应看起来只是「结果少了一点」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类检查的统一调度\">三类检查的统一调度</h2><p>三类一致性检查在实现上是同一套东西的不同断言，可以用一个统一的检查调度来表达，避免为每类写一套重复的回放逻辑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查</th>\n<th>需要的回放请求</th>\n<th>断言数量</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分页</td>\n<td>同一查询 × 多页</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>低（只需结果列表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合</td>\n<td>同一查询 × 1（带聚合）</td>\n<td>2~4</td>\n<td>中（需拉取聚合桶）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折叠</td>\n<td>同一查询 × 1（带折叠字段）</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>低（需折叠键）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本最高的是分页（要发多次请求），因此在采样受限时应优先保证「分页 + 折叠」这类低成本的检查覆盖全量，聚合检查按维度重要性抽样。这个优先级安排与 <a href=\"../perf-correctness-regression/latency-distribution-compare\">延迟分布回归（p50/p95/p99）</a> 的取舍逻辑一致：先保证覆盖面，再保证深度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分页、聚合、折叠三类一致性检查的都是「跨请求关系」，单次响应看起来正常是它们的共同伪装。</li>\n<li>分页检查无重复、无遗漏、全局有序三性质，需要区分冻结索引与增量索引两种回放模式。</li>\n<li>聚合检查恒等式与桶集合稳定性，计数变化需要容差以过滤分片归并造成的微小抖动。</li>\n<li>折叠检查代表选择的稳定性与组容量守恒；「换代表」必须在折叠前识别，不能混同于集合变化。</li>\n<li>三类检查共享同一套回放机制，按成本排优先级：分页/折叠全量、聚合抽样。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>结果集 Diff 到此完成行为层面的比对。下一章 <a href=\"../perf-correctness-regression/\">性能与正确性回归</a> 转向「结果之外」——同样的结果是否以同样的代价得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分页/聚合/折叠一致性 Diff","id":"分页-聚合-折叠一致性-diff"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类一致性的对象与失效形态","id":"核心概念-三类一致性的对象与失效形态"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么这三类一致性在回放里特别重要","id":"为什么这三类一致性在回放里特别重要"},{"level":2,"text":"分页一致性：跨页拼接检查","id":"分页一致性-跨页拼接检查"},{"level":3,"text":"深分页与游标","id":"深分页与游标"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合一致性：恒等式与桶稳定性","id":"聚合一致性-恒等式与桶稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"恒等式检查","id":"恒等式检查"},{"level":3,"text":"桶集合稳定性","id":"桶集合稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"折叠一致性：代表文档与组容量","id":"折叠一致性-代表文档与组容量"},{"level":3,"text":"代表选择的稳定性","id":"代表选择的稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"组容量与结果数守恒","id":"组容量与结果数守恒"},{"level":2,"text":"三类检查的统一调度","id":"三类检查的统一调度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"排序位移与变化度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/result-set-diff/ranking-displacement-metric"},"next":{"title":"延迟分布回归（p50/p95/p99）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/perf-correctness-regression/latency-distribution-compare"}}